sequenceDiagram
    actor Browser
    participant API as Spring Boot
    participant QC as QuestionClassifier (Type)
    participant QIC as QueryIntentClassifier (Retrieval Intent)

    Browser->>API: question text

    Note over API,QC: Phase 1 — Gate & Question Type
    API->>QC: classify(question)

    QC->>QC: Check length — too short or bare word
    alt INVALID
        QC-->>API: earlyReturn — "Could you rephrase?"
        API-->>Browser: message + done
    end

    QC->>QC: Match OUT_OF_SCOPE pattern (weather / news / recipes...)
    alt OUT_OF_SCOPE
        QC-->>API: earlyReturn — "That's outside what I can help with."
        API-->>Browser: message + done
    end

    QC->>QC: Match STRATEGIC pattern (salary / weaknesses / conflict...)
    alt STRATEGIC
        QC-->>API: earlyReturn — "Happy to discuss in our conversation."
        API-->>Browser: message + done
    end

    QC->>QC: Match CONTACT pattern (phone / email / how to contact...)
    alt CONTACT_REDIRECT
        QC-->>API: earlyReturn — "Please download my resume."
        API-->>Browser: message + done
    end

    QC->>QC: Match FACTUAL pattern (how long / when / where are you...)
    alt FACTUAL
        QC-->>API: FACTUAL — strict citation prompt
    end

    QC->>QC: Match BEHAVIORAL / TECHNICAL pattern
    alt BEHAVIORAL / TECHNICAL
        QC-->>API: BEHAVIORAL / TECHNICAL — STAR/story prompt
    end

    QC-->>API: BEHAVIORAL (default)

    Note over API,QIC: Phase 2 — Retrieval Intent Tags (BEHAVIORAL / TECHNICAL only)
    API->>QIC: classify(question) — rule-based keyword match first
    QIC->>QIC: Match against 8 intent keywords
    alt Keywords matched
        QIC-->>API: 1-3 intent_tags from rules
    else No keyword match
        QIC->>QIC: LLM fallback — classify via Claude prompt
        QIC-->>API: 1-3 intent_tags from LLM
    end

    Note right of QIC: Intents: architecture, production_issue, leadership, delivery, technical_depth, ambiguity, conflict, growth

    API->>API: Continue to strategy selection → retrieval
